{
  "release": {
    "tag_target": "chrome_stable",
    "tag": "v{chrome_stable_version}",
    "title": "Chrome++ {chrome_stable_version}",
    "body": "自动构建的 Google Chrome 便携版，集成 Chrome++ 便携化增强组件。\n\n> 安装、更新与常见问题：https://piracola.github.io/ChromiumPortable/chrome/\n\n## 版本\n- Stable 版本: {chrome_stable_version}\n- Beta 版本: {chrome_beta_version}\n- Stable ARM64 版本: {chrome_stable_arm64_version}\n- Beta ARM64 版本: {chrome_beta_arm64_version}\n\n## 使用说明\n- 解压到任意目录，双击 `开始.bat` 创建桌面快捷方式。\n- 用户数据保存在与 `Chrome` 文件夹同级的 `Data`、`Cache` 目录，随目录整体移动。\n- 更新时只覆盖 `Chrome` 文件夹即可，`Data` 与 `Cache` 不受影响。\n\n## 文件校验\n| 文件 | 大小 | SHA256 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `{chrome_stable_archive}` | {chrome_stable_size} | `{chrome_stable_sha256}` |\n| `{chrome_beta_archive}` | {chrome_beta_size} | `{chrome_beta_sha256}` |\n| `{chrome_stable_arm64_archive}` | {chrome_stable_arm64_size} | `{chrome_stable_arm64_sha256}` |\n| `{chrome_beta_arm64_archive}` | {chrome_beta_arm64_size} | `{chrome_beta_arm64_sha256}` |\n\n## 构建信息\n- 构建时间: {date}\n- Chrome++ 版本: {chrome_plus_version}\n- 构建记录: {run_url}\n- 上游发行说明: https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/\n"
  },
  "targets": {
    "chrome_stable": {
      "name": "Chrome",
      "display_name": "Chrome++",
      "output_dir": "Chrome",
      "exe_name": "..\\chrome.exe",
      "architecture": "x64",
      "env_prefix": "STABLE",
      "provider": {
        "type": "google_omaha",
        "channel": "win_stable_x64"
      },
      "version_root": "Chrome-bin",
      "layout": "move_version_root",
      "chrome_plus_dir": "chrome++",
      "ini_location": "app_root",
      "version_dll_location": "app_root",
      "forbidden_file_names": [
        "GoogleUpdate.exe",
        "GoogleUpdater.exe",
        "updater.exe"
      ],
      "start_script": "开始.bat",
      "archive_name": "Chrome++_stable_{version}_{date}.7z",
      "release": {
        "asset_match": "^Chrome\\+\\+_stable_[0-9]+\\.",
        "version_pattern": "Stable\\s*版本[:：]\\s*(\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+)",
        "asset_match_mode": "regex"
      }
    },
    "chrome_beta": {
      "name": "Chrome",
      "display_name": "Chrome++ Beta",
      "output_dir": "Chrome",
      "exe_name": "..\\chrome.exe",
      "architecture": "x64",
      "env_prefix": "BETA",
      "provider": {
        "type": "google_omaha",
        "channel": "win_beta_x64"
      },
      "version_root": "Chrome-bin",
      "layout": "move_version_root",
      "chrome_plus_dir": "chrome++",
